Z||000000||SCCA FIERO||12-29-2001||06:00 PM||||I know Cliff spends a lot of time doing this forum for all of us. I also know it costs him a butt load of cash as well.<P>He has never asked for any money, never has any annoying banners either. But what if we <B>wanted</B> to give a few bucks to support our hangout?<P>If you (Cliff) had a Paypal account and gave us the account name to deposit money to, I think it would make some of us feel better. I know this place has saved me hundreds, maybe thousands of dollars! I think I would feel better for giving about 10 bucks. I have lived here rent free for about 2 1/2 years.<P>Come on, Cliff, take our money!<P>Good idea? Bad idea?<P>||||reg||1
